  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapid response to flooding in Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the context of the flood emergencies in Bolivia, the Lima Regional Hub - COSUDE, in coordination with the Swiss Embassy in Bolivia, has assessed the need to develop a rapid response intervention, which on this occasion would be carried out in partnership between Practical Action and Solidar Suisse, with priority in the department of La Paz.</narrative>
